    <item>
      <title>荷兰央行以“地缘政治动荡”为由削减在美国的黄金储备</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/03/world/europe/netherlands-gold-reserves-us.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[荷兰从纽约联邦储备银行移出了约 90 吨黄金，这是今年第二个宣布减少或取消美国黄金持有量的欧洲国家。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/03/world/europe/netherlands-gold-reserves-us.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 20:07:38 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
