    <item>
      <title>法官建议特朗普邮寄投票规则可能导致“重大剥夺选举权”</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/03/us/politics/mail-ballots-usps-restraining-order.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[法官英迪拉·塔尔瓦尼 (Indira Talwani) 表示，邮政局似乎正在尝试一项随意的“实验”，新规则可能会导致有效选票被丢弃。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/03/us/politics/mail-ballots-usps-restraining-order.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 19:42:36 GMT</pubDate>
