    <item>
      <title>女权运动的化身格洛丽亚·斯泰纳姆 (Gloria Steinem) 去世，享年 92 岁</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/03/us/politics/gloria-steinem-dead.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[她挑战性别歧视观念，帮助女性培养自我价值感，并在工作、家庭和整个社会中获得一定程度的平等。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/03/us/politics/gloria-steinem-dead.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 19:35:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
